## Print Shop (menu planner)

Five print documents, **two header templates**:

| Header | Documents |
|--------|-----------|
| **Personalized** (name + date) | Weekly meal plan, Grocery list |
| **Generic** (brand + title) | Food list, For Best Results, FAQ |

**User-authored copy is fixed everywhere** — see `.cursor/rules/user-authored-copy.mdc`. Never reauthor or ad lib; use source text as written unless the user supplies exact replacement words.

**Product terminology (diet / food plan / program / questionnaire)** — see `.cursor/rules/product-terminology.mdc`. Three product layers plus locked **questionnaire** naming; do not interchange.

**Serving sizes & food-list gram weights** — macro-gram portions (8g protein, 14g carbs, prep state, dry vs cooked). See `.cursor/rules/burn-engine-servings.mdc`. **No calories** in portions or UI; engine calorie loops are in `docs/burn-engine-internal-calorie-loops.md` only.

**Generic doc content is fixed** — do not ad lib or refactor copy/layout unless explicitly requested. Source data:

| Document | Data |
|----------|------|
| Food list | `data/foodListPrintout.js` + tips Q&A in `data/*TipsPrintout.js`; food names from program |
| For Best Results | `data/forBestResultsPrintout.js` |
| FAQ | `data/handbookFaqPrintout.js` |

**Print Shop PDF pipeline:** View registry in `js/printShopViews.js`. Server: `server/pdf/` (PDFKit via `PrintPdfCreator`). Client: `printShopClient.js` (fetch), `printShopDelivery.js` (new tab), `plannerPrintPayload.js` (planner data). Static docs — `GET /api/print/pdf`. Personalized docs — `POST /api/print/pdf`. Verify: `npm run verify:pdf`.

**Deprecated:** `pwa-burn-and-build` (archived), `gettheburnandbuildapp.com`, `/myplan/` phone app.

## KWarner program-report preview PDF

Active printout work uses the **locked preview pipeline** — see `.cursor/rules/kwarner-preview-pdf.mdc`.

After any PDF/layout change: `npm run render:kwarner-preview` → commit versioned + latest PDFs + `js/kwarnerPreviewBuild.js` → push to `main` → give user raw `raw.githubusercontent.com` download links (see `.cursor/rules/kwarner-preview-pdf.mdc`).
